# PAM configuration for the Quickshell lock screen.
#
# Quickshell's PamContext only uses the `auth` type (the other types need root
# to verify), so this file only needs auth rules.
#
# Password only:
auth required pam_unix.so

# To allow a fingerprint instead of a password, or as well as:
#   auth sufficient pam_fprintd.so
#   auth required   pam_unix.so
#
# `sufficient` means "if this succeeds, stop here" -- so a fingerprint unlocks
# immediately without asking for a password. Swap the two lines above for those
# two to enable it.
